{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/12908-if-you-come-out-of-the-hedge-and-can-t-find-other-local-changelings-do-you","id":12908,"title":"If you come out of the Hedge and can't find other local Changelings do you...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-17T13:15:51-08:00","id":12908,"title":"If you come out of the Hedge and can't find other local Changelings do you...","content":"Okay so just a question, what do you think would be a more interesting game, if your PC group comes out of the Hedge and they find no local Freehold do they start one themselves or would you make a game about travelling trying to find the right freehold for yourself? What do you think your group would do if you presented this in the beginning of a chronicle? And what do you yourself think would be the most interesting and fun option?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T13:25:22-08:00","id":12913,"title":"","content":"Presumably, these fresh-from-the-thorns changelings would have no idea that there are enough other people like them to build an entire society. All they would know is that they're not...in <i>that place...</i>anymore, or so it would seem. With no concept of the Freehold, they'd probably stay together because they just don't have anyone else and try to figure out a way to stay on Earth, maybe try to go back to their old lives--and there won't be anyone to tell them about fetches, either...<br /> <br /> Once they find out how not-alone they really are, then they can start to think about moving into a Freehold or organizing one of their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T13:43:29-08:00","id":12929,"title":"","content":"So which one though? I was asking which one do you think your group would naturally fall into or which one do you think you would prefer?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T13:48:29-08:00","id":12933,"title":"","content":"Do remember that the reason that Freeholds exist is because Changelings are exiting the Hedge via Trods. You might get one or two Changelings not exiting in an already populated area, but mostly, they will end up with other Changelings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/863-doctor-lazarus","name":"Doctor Lazarus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T13:55:41-08:00","id":12938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Doctor Lazarus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/12908-if-you-come-out-of-the-hedge-and-can-t-find-other-local-changelings-do-you?p=12933#post12933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do remember that the reason that Freeholds exist is because Changelings are exiting the Hedge via Trods. You might get one or two Changelings not exiting in an already populated area, but mostly, they will end up with other Changelings.</div> </div> </div> </div>Freeholds form around trends around trods. But that doesn't mean you can't pop up in an area with no other changelings. You could for instance just appear in an area with a low number of Trods, like say just one. Or it could have had a Freehold that for whatever reason was wiped out or decided to leave the area. And the PCs could for instance be all escaping from the same Keeper. What you are pointing out is a non issue, there are plenty of reasons this could happen, its just more common to appear in areas with changeling activity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T15:31:28-08:00","id":13000,"title":"","content":"Changelings who just come out of the Hedge and don't meet existing changelings would not know anything about freeholds. What's in the core book about them is generally considered to be taught to changelings in their intro period.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T15:36:40-08:00","id":13004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/12908-if-you-come-out-of-the-hedge-and-can-t-find-other-local-changelings-do-you?p=13000#post13000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Changelings who just come out of the Hedge and don't meet existing changelings would not know anything about freeholds. What's in the core book about them is generally considered to be taught to changelings in their intro period.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah but a lot of things are instinctive, like whether you want to form a community or hide yourself. The books even say changelings can even join courts without being introduced to them by other changelings. I expect a lot of things get reinvented all over the world as far as changeling history goes.<br /> <br /> You don't have to be told &quot;hey do you want to look for others of your kind or do you want to just make a life here&quot;. That's kind of instinctive","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T16:07:51-08:00","id":13026,"title":"","content":"Looking for others or making your own way is one thing, joining a court and making a freehold are a bit different. Anyone can make deals with the seasons, but the seasonal courts didn't always exist, it took exceptional individuals to form them.<br /> <br /> It depends on how you want to run it, on the people involved. If they had a Durance that was secluded, they might not know other changelings exist. If they escaped with others, they might want to join even more. Changelings just out of the Hedge might not know there's other True Fae, that there are privateers and loyalists, that there are changelings just as predatory as the Keepers, changelings who are almost Keepers themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T12:44:53-08:00","id":14228,"title":"","content":"I'd say their actions would probably depend on what you present them with at the beginning of the game. Left to their own devices they probably would just hide and try not to go back, but if they spent their durances with some changelings that were recaptured after joining courts they may decide to seek something out once they return. You could even give them the option to have been inducted into the courts in Arcadia or perhaps even spoken with the seasons themselves so they could start with a mantle and potentially even manifest a crown and become the leaders of their new freehold.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/807-arcadianawakened","name":"ArcadianAwakened","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}